hapter","html":"4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_L,\\mathrm{index}(\\equiv_L)\">\\(\\equiv_L,\\mathrm{index}(\\equiv_L)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"54826de3b846056d\" href=\"?note=54826de3b846056d\" title=\"73-df-nerode-quotient-notation\">73-df-nerode-quotient-notation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DFA},L(M),\\mathrm{REGULAR}\">\\(\\mathrm{DFA},L(M),\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6d26348026d8f259\" href=\"?note=6d26348026d8f259\" title=\"73-df-dfa-notation\">73-df-dfa-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"11d1c892f16eef2d\" href=\"?note=11d1c892f16eef2d\" title=\"73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation\">73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a2d140de13ec8897\" href=\"?note=a2d140de13ec8897\" title=\"73-df-regular-language-notation\">73-df-regular-language-notation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\">\\(M,N\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1\">\\(\\pi_1\\)</span> 为首分量投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_M\">\\(Q_M\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Minimal}_L(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Minimal}_L(M)\\)</span> 在下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.5}\\vdash\nQ_M\\coloneqq\\pi_1(M)\\quad(M\\in\\mathrm{DFA})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.5}\\vdash\nQ_M\\coloneqq\\pi_1(M)\\quad(M\\in\\mathrm{DFA})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Minimal}_L(M)\\leftrightarrow M\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\land L(M)=L\\land\n\\forall N\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\;(L(N)=L\\to|Q_M|\\le|Q_N|)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Minimal}_L(M)\\leftrightarrow M\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\land L(M)=L\\land\n\\forall N\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\;(L(N)=L\\to|Q_M|\\le|Q_N|)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.5}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{index}(\\equiv_L)&lt;\\aleph_0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.5}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{index}(\\equiv_L)&lt;\\aleph_0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.5}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\;\\mathrm{Minimal}_L(M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.5}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\;\\mathrm{Minimal}_L(M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.5}\\vdash\n\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\;(\\mathrm{Minimal}_L(M)\\to|Q_M|=\\mathrm{index}(\\equiv_L))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.5}\\vdash\n\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{DFA}\\;(\\mathrm{Minimal}_L(M)\\to|Q_M|=\\mathrm{index}(\\equiv_L))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是旧目录的兼容接口。数字标签与 aliases 仅是本目录历史编号，不对应第三版的定理或定义编号；书源定位以 source_ref 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-notation","status":"resolved","id":"6d26348026d8f259","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation","status":"resolved","id":"11d1c892f16eef2d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-regular-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"a2d140de13ec8897","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-regular-language-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nerode-quotient-notation","status":"resolved","id":"54826de3b846056d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nerode-quotient-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-finite-residual-characterization","status":"resolved","id":"ce1461d3e7bc342b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-finite-residual-characterization]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","an